error: `File.mapRead` holds the thread until it is done, and an async function does not hold its thread
  the tasks of async functions share a few threads: one that holds its thread keeps the others from running
  --> error_file_map_async.sg:3:31
 3 |     var map = try unsafe File.mapRead(read path)
   |                               ^^^^^^^
  hint: `await unsafe File.mapReadAsync(read path)` does the same work without holding the thread
